0..57 Comment "/// This source states a flow between two function types."
58..61 Comment "///"
62..138 Comment "/// A schema translator makes a new-schema reader into an old-schema reader."
139..203 Comment "/// `Flow.arrow` changes the function domain contravariantly and"
204..229 Comment "/// preserves its result."
230..233 Comment "///"
234..304 Comment "/// The checker constructs the reader flow from the schema translator."
305..356 Comment "/// It rides the new reader back to the old schema."
357..360 Comment "///"
